  "title": "Colouring the square of a planar graph",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture Let $G$ be a planar graph of maximum degree $\\Delta$. The chromatic number of its square is\n\n- at most $7$ if $\\Delta =3$,\n- at most $\\Delta+5$ if $4\\leq\\Delta\\leq 7$,\n- at most $\\left\\lfloor\\frac32\\,\\Delta\\right\\rfloor+1$ if $\\Delta\\ge8$.",
